⨯ keywords: `context` is a keyword and may not be used as an identifier
  @ test.idl:3:12

 2 │ interface Service {
 3 │     string context();
   │            ˆˆˆˆˆˆˆ this is an IDL keyword
 4 │     long abstract();
 5 │ };

  ? the keyword can be escaped by changing to `_context`
  * keywords are matched case-insensitively against identifiers

